-capture-workers/multivariable/14062447/assets/35e378bca35f4b0822c713556065415d59b5c566ec8fcc8e3124256aac7b7f14.png)\n\nWe have that $P(x,y)=\\operatorname{sin}⁡y+2x$ and $Q(x,y)={x}^{5}-3y.$ So,\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\frac{∂P}{∂x}=2,\\,\\frac{∂Q}{∂y} & =-3.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nWe can express the rectangular region $D$ as follows:\n\n$$\nD={(x,y):-1\\le x\\le 1,\\,-1\\le y\\le 1}\n$$\n\nTherefore, applying Green's theorem in flux form, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{∮}_{C}F\\cdot n\\,\\text{d}s & ={∮}_{C}P\\,dy-Q\\,dx \\\\  & ={∬}_{D}(\\frac{∂P}{∂x}+\\frac{∂Q}{∂y})\\text{d}A \\\\  & ={∬}_{D}(2-3)\\,\\text{d}A \\\\  & ={\\int }_{-1}^{1}{\\int }_{-1}^{1}(-1)\\,\\text{d}x\\,\\text{d}y \\\\  & =-{\\int }_{-1}^{1}x\\,{|}_{-1}^{1}\\,dy \\\\  & =-{\\int }_{-1}^{1}(1-(-1))\\,dy \\\\  & =-2{\\int }_{-1}^{1}\\,dy \\\\  & =-2y\\,{|}_{-1}^{1} \\\\  & =-4.\\end{aligned}\n$$" 13194139535310 true] [17592186343120 1000 #edb/ref 17592186343121 13194139535310 true] [17592186343120 1000 #edb/ref 17592186343122 13194139535310 true] [17592186343120 1000 #edb/ref 17592186343123 13194139535310 true] [17592186343120 1000 #edb/ref 17592186343124 13194139535310 true] [17592186343120 1000 #edb/ref 17592186343125 13194139535310 true] [17592186343120 1040 #edb/ref 17592186045450 13194139535310 true] [17592186343120 1041 "selection" 13194139535310 true] [17592186343120 1104 #edb/ref 17592186343123 13194139535310 true] [17592186343120 1110 #uuid "c746d89b-0283-592e-98d3-4260895b3921" 13194139535310 true] [17592186343121 1034 "8" 13194139535310 true] [17592186343121 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139535310 true] [17592186343121 1111 #uuid "781e8ea0-cccd-5ae4-91c0-e4088a63b289" 13194139535310 true] [17592186343122 1034 "2" 13194139535310 true] [17592186343122 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139535310 true] [17592186343122 1111 #uuid "d967f26b-a825-5d15-9bfc-25c118cd8a5b" 13194139535310 true] [17592186343123 1034 "-4" 13194139535310 true] [17592186343123 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139