e rectangular region $D$ as follows:\n\n$$\nD={(x,y):-1\\le x\\le 1,\\,0\\le y\\le 1}\n$$\n\nTherefore, applying Green's theorem in flux form, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{∮}_{C}F\\cdot n\\,\\text{d}s & ={∮}_{C}P\\,dy-Q\\,dx \\\\  & ={∬}_{D}(\\frac{∂P}{∂x}+\\frac{∂Q}{∂y})\\text{d}A \\\\  & ={∬}_{D}(-9{x}^{2}-12x{y}^{2})\\,\\text{d}A \\\\  & ={\\int }_{0}^{1}{\\int }_{-1}^{1}(-9{x}^{2}-12x{y}^{2})\\,\\text{d}x\\,\\text{d}y \\\\  & ={\\int }_{0}^{1}[-3{x}^{3}-6{x}^{2}{y}^{2}]_{-1}^{1}\\,dy \\\\  & ={\\int }_{0}^{1}[(-3(1)^{3}-6(1)^{2}{y}^{2})-(-3(-1)^{3}-6(-1)^{2}{y}^{2})]\\,dy \\\\  & ={\\int }_{0}^{1}(-6)\\,dy \\\\  & =-6y\\,{|}_{0}^{1} \\\\  & =-6.\\end{aligned}\n$$" 13194139535310 true] [17592186343127 1000 #edb/ref 17592186343128 13194139535310 true] [17592186343127 1000 #edb/ref 17592186343129 13194139535310 true] [17592186343127 1000 #edb/ref 17592186343130 13194139535310 true] [17592186343127 1000 #edb/ref 17592186343131 13194139535310 true] [17592186343127 1000 #edb/ref 17592186343132 13194139535310 true] [17592186343127 1040 #edb/ref 17592186045450 13194139535310 true] [17592186343127 1041 "selection" 13194139535310 true] [17592186343127 1104 #edb/ref 17592186343132 13194139535310 true] [17592186343127 1110 #uuid "b1dfdd52-f2b0-574b-bf39-618cb72cfe47" 13194139535310 true] [17592186343128 1034 "e-6" 13194139535310 true] [17592186343128 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139535310 true] [17592186343128 1111 #uuid "aee01bec-10a6-56d0-a6a6-0a17b71d45ec" 13194139535310 true] [17592186343129 1034 "-5" 13194139535310 true] [17592186343129 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139535310 true] [17592186343129 1111 #uuid "0b2118a5-ce28-5d05-b475-86c3270e9784" 13194139535310 true] [17592186343130 1034 "-3" 13194139535310 true] [17592186343130 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139535310 true] [17592186343130 1111 #uuid "3b2cc6c8-464a-59a5-96e8-656aabba7e0e" 13194139535310 true] [17592186343131 1034 "-12" 13194139535310 true] [17592186343131 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 131