s & ={∮}_{C}P\\,dy-Q\\,dx \\\\  & ={∬}_{D}(\\frac{∂P}{∂x}+\\frac{∂Q}{∂y})\\text{d}A \\\\  & ={∬}_{D}(12yx+6y)\\,\\text{d}A \\\\  & ={\\int }_{0}^{2}{\\int }_{0}^{\\sqrt{x}}(12yx+6y)\\,\\text{d}y\\,\\text{d}x \\\\  & ={\\int }_{0}^{2}(6{y}^{2}x+3{y}^{2})\\,{|}_{0}^{\\sqrt{x}}\\,dx \\\\  & ={\\int }_{0}^{2}(6{x}^{2}+3x)\\,dx \\\\  & =(2{x}^{3}+\\frac{3{x}^{2}}{2})\\,{|}_{0}^{2} \\\\  & =22-0 \\\\  & =22.\\end{aligned}\n$$" 13194139535310 true] [17592186343134 1000 #edb/ref 17592186343135 13194139535310 true] [17592186343134 1000 #edb/ref 17592186343136 13194139535310 true] [17592186343134 1000 #edb/ref 17592186343137 13194139535310 true] [17592186343134 1000 #edb/ref 17592186343138 13194139535310 true] [17592186343134 1000 #edb/ref 17592186343139 13194139535310 true] [17592186343134 1040 #edb/ref 17592186045450 13194139535310 true] [17592186343134 1041 "selection" 13194139535310 true] [17592186343134 1104 #edb/ref 17592186343135 13194139535310 true] [17592186343134 1110 #uuid "0425be1a-7849-5c06-aafe-8f78d3552294" 13194139535310 true] [17592186343135 1034 "22" 13194139535310 true] [17592186343135 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139535310 true] [17592186343135 1111 #uuid "ef6acfa9-5471-59a3-8a05-5f7f2e541e60" 13194139535310 true] [17592186343136 1034 "25" 13194139535310 true] [17592186343136 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139535310 true] [17592186343136 1111 #uuid "623db9e8-56f8-525b-bb6e-41e1865083e1" 13194139535310 true] [17592186343137 1034 "17" 13194139535310 true] [17592186343137 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139535310 true] [17592186343137 1111 #uuid "88445497-b1ab-50b3-a14a-9825368bfead" 13194139535310 true] [17592186343138 1034 "\\frac{50}{3}" 13194139535310 true] [17592186343138 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139535310 true] [17592186343138 1111 #uuid "bb4910d2-2735-5005-b68c-c8e5bb6815b0" 13194139535310 true] [17592186343139 1034 "\\frac{45}{2}" 13194139535310 true] [17592186343139 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139535310 true] [17592186343139 1111 #uuid "4f824283-0d18-5dd2-9a5b-812865130533" 13194139535310 true] [17592186343140 1017 #edb/ref 17592186343141 13194139535310 true] [17592186343140 1089 "q-127316" 13194139535310 true] [17592186343140 1091 #edb/ref 17592186045465 13194139535310 true] [17592186343140 1100 "Use the flux form of Green's theorem to calculate the flux of the vector field\n\n$$\nF(x,y)=⟨x-\\sqrt{y},\\,y-\\sqrt{x}⟩\n$$\n\nthrough the boundary of the region enclosed by the curve $y=\\operatorname{sin}⁡x$ and the line $y=0$ for $0\\le x\\le \\frac{\\pi }{2}.$" 13194139535310 true] [17592186343140 1113 #uuid "98a60dee-772a-58ff-8285-32051d418b46" 13194139535310 true] [17592186343140 1145 "Let $C$ be a positively oriented, piecewise-smooth, simple closed curve in the plane, and let $D$ be the region bounded by $C.$ If $F=P\\,i+Q\\,j,$ and $P$ and $Q$ have continuous first derivatives on an open region containing $D,$ then the flux form of Green's theorem states that\n\n$$\n{∮}_{C}F\\cdot n\\,\\text{d}s={∬}_{D}\\text{div}\\,F\\,\\text{d}A,\n$$\n\nwhich is equivalent to\n\n$$\n{∮}_{C}P\\,dy-Q\\,dx={∬}_{D}(\\frac{∂P}{∂x}+\\frac{∂Q}{∂y})\\text{d}A.\n$$\n\nThe region $D$ and the curve $C$ for this case are shown below.\n\n![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/multivariable/14062447/assets/c4dd4d03bdfcf6c3d597e2fdef8681e4f3316b3f276cb9967933b61b0dc90976.png)\n\nWe have that $P(x,y)=x-\\sqrt{y}$ and $Q(x,y)=y-\\sqrt{x}.$ Therefore,\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\frac{∂P}{∂x}=1,\\,\\frac{∂Q}{∂y} & =1.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nWe can express the region $D$ as a type I region as follows:\n\n$$\nD={(x,y):0\\le x\\le \\frac{\\pi }{2},\\,0\\le y\\le \\operatorname{sin}⁡x}\n$$\n\nTherefore, applying Green's theorem in flux form, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{∮}_{C}F\\cdot n\\,\\text{d}s & ={∮}_{C}P\\,dy-Q\\,dx \\\\  & ={∬}_{D}(\\frac{∂P}{∂x}+\\frac{∂Q}{∂y})\\text{d}A \\\\  & ={∬}_{D}(1+1)\\,\\text{d}A \\\\  & =2{\\int }_{0}^{\\pi /2}{\\int }_{0}^{\\operatorname{sin}⁡x}\\,\\text{d}y\\,\\text{d}x \\\\  & =2{\\int }_{0}^{\\pi /2}y\\,{|}_{0}^{\\operatorname{sin}⁡x}\\,dx \\\\  & =2{\\int }_{0}^{\\pi /2}\\operatorname{sin}⁡x\\,dx \\\\  & =2(-\\operatorname{cos}⁡x)\\,{|}_{0}^{\\pi /2} \\\\  & =2(0-(-1)) \\\\  & =2.\\end{aligned}\n$$" 13194139535310 true] [17592186343141 1000 #edb/ref 17592186343142 13194139535310 true] [17592186343141 1000 #edb/ref 17592186343143 13194139535310 true] [17592186343141 1000 #edb/ref 17592186343144 13194139535310 true] [17592186343141 1000 #edb/ref 17592186343145 13194139535310 true] [17592186343141 1000 #edb/ref 17592186343146 13194139535310 true] [17592186343141 1040 #edb/ref 17592186045450 13194139535310 true] [17592186343141 1041 "selection" 13194139535310 true] [17592186343141 1104 #edb/ref 17592186343143 13194139535310 true] [17592186343141 1110 #uuid "5081af50-ef6c-59bc-8282-e57c5cedbb11" 13194139535310 true] [17592186343142 1034 "\\frac{3\\pi }{2}" 13194139535310 true] [17592186343142 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139535310 true] [17592186343142 1111 #uuid "bb70e29b-8e55-55e0-89c3-8f1a00af0585" 13194139535310 true] [17592186343143 1034 "2" 13194139535310 true] [17592186343143 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139535310 true] [17592186343143 1111 #uuid "5afee28c-5803-5da5-abe7-f7e5a8714186" 13194139535310 true] [17592186343144 1034 "6" 13194139535310 true] [17592186343144 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139535310 true] [17592186343144 1111 #uuid "43fc078d-02de-5571-a12a-4a1aee55bab5" 13194139535310 true] [17592186343145 1034 "3\\pi " 13194139535310 true] [17592186343145 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139535310 true] [17592186343145 1111 #uuid "a11c141e-27fb-5065-b8b9-bf744c309426" 13194139535310 true] [17592186343146 1034 "5" 13194139535310 true] [17592186343146 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139535310 true] [17592186343146 1111 #uuid "8b755a5c-4951-53e6-a617-9e102bf53ed5" 13194139535310 true] [17592186343147 1017 #edb/ref 17592186343148 13194139535310 true] [17592186343147 1089 "q-